e runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids October to November and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle saw March to April at 213% of normal and November to December at 47%. So far in 2026, February to March came in at 26% of normal on the middle. Grid 18730 had its driest year in 1954 at 49%.</p>"}
